{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S02、S04、S13等段的感受提示偏密，部分水面、小船意象也略显用力，Y在直接呈现身体感受时反而更自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X通过关键词加亮，让观众即使不逐字阅读，也能迅速抓住每段心理变化的支点；话与感受交替，加上感受按音乐时点出现，使叙事和听觉更容易同步。更重要的是，X把人物从最初害怕暴露需要，到逐渐接受自己的喜欢、反复担忧失去，最后不再索取永远保证的心理过程串得更清楚，水面、摇荡、小船等意象也形成了贯穿始终的感受线索。整体上，X不仅告诉观众他在想什么，还让人感受到这些想法如何随着音乐起伏而发生变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "78320d03-d94c-4474-a50e-99a878b997b6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T010251725984Z", "elapsed_seconds": 90.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:04:21.950390+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f687209ee203a6f3f02c774427267e6edb328ebc143ac9cd6b5be1420292f4d2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool